ont-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 25px;\n    background: #56c5b0;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 815px) {\n    .page {\n      transform-origin: top center;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder hero-photo\">\n      <span class=\"sr-only\">[Photo: aerial view of the ocean with a small boat]</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      <div class=\"xavier\">XAVIER'S</div>\n      <div class=\"school\">SCHOOL</div>\n      <div class=\"tagline\">OF GIFTED YOUNGSTERS</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder boat\">\n      <span class=\"sr-only\">[Boat: upper-right]</span>\n      <div class=\"hull\"></div>\n      <div class=\"line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"cross\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wake\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">The Importance of Ocean Conservation:</p>\n      <h1>Understanding<br>the Threats and Solutions</h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-description\">\n        The ocean is a vital resource that supports life on Earth, yet it faces a growing number<br>\n        of threats from human activities. This poster provides an overview of the importance of<br>\n        ocean conservation and highlights the key threats facing the world's oceans.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"content\">\n    <section class=\"background-block\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Background</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-copy\">\n        The world's oceans cover more than 70% of the Earth's surface and support a diverse\n        range of ecosystems, including coral reefs, kelp forests, and open ocean habitats.\n        However, the ocean is facing a growing number of threats, including climate change,\n        overfishing, and plastic pollution. These threats can have far-reaching impacts on both\n        marine and human life.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"methodology-block\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Methodology</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-copy\">\n        This poster presents a review of the latest research on the threats facing the world's\n        oceans and the solutions being proposed to address them. The research draws on a range\n        of academic sources, including peer-reviewed journal articles and reports from\n        international organizations.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"chart-block\">\n      <h2 class=\"chart-title\">Global Ocean Heat</h2>\n      <div class=\"placeholder chart-placeholder\">\n        <span class=\"sr-only\">[Chart: Global Ocean Heat line and area chart]</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 466 194\" width=\"466\" height=\"194\" aria-label=\"Global Ocean Heat chart\">\n          <g font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">\n            <g stroke=\"#28454a\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n              <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"466\" y2=\"12\"/>\n              <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"466\" y2=\"46\"/>\n              <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"466\" y2=\"80\"/>\n              <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"114\" x2=\"466\" y2=\"114\"/>\n              <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"466\" y2=\"148\"/>\n              <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"466\" y2=\"182\"/>\n            </g>\n\n            <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"35\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#667b7d\" stroke-width=\".7\"/>\n\n            <path d=\"M67,144 L128,148 L189,134 L250,138 L311,100 L372,45 L435,12 L435,114 L67,114 Z\"\n                  fill=\"#3b8798\" opacity=\".92\"/>\n            <path d=\"M67,144 L128,148 L189,134 L250,138 L311,100 L372,45 L435,12\"\n                  fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#55d0ed\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n\n            <g fill=\"#f2f2f2\" stroke=\"#67d6ef\" stroke-width=\".7\">\n              <circle cx=\"67\" cy=\"144\" r=\"3\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"148\" r=\"3\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"189\" cy=\"134\" r=\"3\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"138\" r=\"3\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"311\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"45\" r=\"3\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"435\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/>\n            </g>\n\n            <g fill=\"#d7d7d7\" font-size=\"9\">\n              <text x=\"22\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\">30</text>\n              <text x=\"22\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"end\">20</text>\n              <text x=\"22\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text>\n              <text x=\"22\" y=\"117\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text>\n              <text x=\"22\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"end\">-10</text>\n              <text x=\"22\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"end\">-20</text>\n            </g>\n\n            <g fill=\"#bfbfbf\" font-size=\"8\">\n              <text x=\"67\" y=\"193\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1960</text>\n              <text x=\"128\" y=\"193\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1970</text>\n              <text x=\"189\" y=\"193\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1980</text>\n              <text x=\"250\" y=\"193\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1990</text>\n              <text x=\"311\" y=\"193\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2000</text>\n              <text x=\"372\" y=\"193\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2010</text>\n              <text x=\"435\" y=\"193\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2020</text>\n            </g>\n          </g>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"profile\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder portrait\">\n        <span class=\"sr-only\">[Portrait: Louise Gardner]</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"contact\">\n        <strong>Louise Gardner</strong>\n        <div>Affiliation: University of ABC</div>\n        <div>E: name@universityname.edu</div>\n        <div>P: 413-748-3004</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"results-block\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Results</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-copy\">\n        The research shows that the threats facing the world's oceans are complex and\n        interrelated, requiring a range of solutions to address them. Key findings include:\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"cards\">\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-number\">1</div>\n        Climate change is causing ocean<br>\n        temperatures to rise, leading to<br>\n        coral bleaching and other impacts<br>\n        on marine life.\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-number\">2</div>\n        Overfishing is depleting fish<br>\n        populations, leading to ecological<br>\n        imbalances and economic losses<br>\n        for coastal communities.\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-number\">3</div>\n        Plastic pollution is a growing<br>\n        threat to marine life, with millions<br>\n        of tons of plastic waste entering<br>\n        the ocean each year.\n      </article>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"references\">\n      <h3>References:</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC). (2019). Special Report on the<br>Ocean and Cryosphere in a Changing Climate.</li>\n        <li>United Nations Environment Programme (UNEP). (2016). Marine Litter and<br>Microplastics: Global Lessons and Research to Inspire Action and Guide Policy Change.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"conclusions\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">Conclusions</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-copy\">\n        This poster demonstrates the urgent need to address threats to the world's oceans.\n        Among the potential solutions are greenhouse gas reductions, sustainable fishing\n        practices, and better waste management and recycling. Protecting our oceans will\n        ensure that life on Earth continues for generations to come.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\"></footer>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
